      "name": "A horizon",
      "entityType": "structure",
      "status": "canonical",
      "definition": "The A horizon represents a soil layer consisting of organic material mixed with weathered mineral products. This zone typically exhibits distinct coloration due to the accumulation of humus and leached clay particles from upper layers.",
