      ],
      "name": "cell membrane",
      "entityType": "structure",
      "status": "canonical",
      "definition": "The cell membrane surrounds all animal cells with a lipid bilayer interspersed with various functional molecules. Also known as the plasma membrane, it regulates material exchange and maintains cellular integrity against external environments.",
