      "name": "chromosome",
      "entityType": "structure",
      "status": "canonical",
      "definition": "A chromosome is a distinct structure located within the nucleus comprising condensed chromatin. It contains DNA sequences that carry genetic information necessary for inheritance and cellular function.",
