      "name": "food chain",
      "entityType": "model",
      "status": "canonical",
      "definition": "A food chain provides a linear representation of energy flow from primary producers to higher-level consumers. This model illustrates how organisms depend on one another for nutrition, describing essential ecosystem structure and dynamic interactions.",
