      "name": "protein",
      "entityType": "material",
      "status": "canonical",
      "definition": "A protein is a biological macromolecule constructed from one or more chains of amino acids. These molecules perform diverse roles such as catalyzing reactions, providing structural support, and regulating cellular processes.",
