      "name": "event horizon",
      "entityType": "concept",
      "status": "canonical",
      "definition": "An event horizon marks a boundary in spacetime where events inside cannot influence the outside world. It defines the region around a black hole beyond which curvature prevents any escape from its gravitational pull.",
