      "name": "pulsar",
      "entityType": "concept",
      "status": "canonical",
      "definition": "A highly magnetised, rapidly rotating neutron star whose beams of radiation sweep past Earth at regular intervals. The pulses are so steady that some pulsars rival atomic clocks as timing references.",
